  - all 7 value tints             #Preview "Tints"
  - full 6-tile telemetry grid    #Preview "Telemetry grid" (Battery/Speed/Inside/Odometer/Charger/Sentry)
N/A (honest, evidence-backed — covenant 1 & 2): loading / error / stale / offline are data-lifecycle
states owned by the PARENT page/state-holder. The web InfoTile source has zero data fetching and zero
such branches (grep of InfoTile.tsx: no hooks, no fetch, no isLoading/error/stale). Inventing them in
the leaf would be silent drift (covenant 9). They are reproduced where they belong — on the data-bound
surfaces (e.g. TirePressureSection/RecentDrivesSection), not on this presentational tile.

